N.4048="label"*85x12<M>
n="isInstallationMode must be ON to run this

Turn first relay On for \"::channelOnOffTime\" seconds,then Off for \"::channelOnOffTime\" seconds, then turn the
second relay On and Off for \"::channelOnOffTime\" seconds,\"then the third, and fourth. During each On or Off cycle, S/H the
channel feedback signal at exactly half the \"::channelOnOffTime\" time, compare that value with the cmd value (it should = 1 if the
relay is working correctly).  Count the number of comparisons,which should = 8 if all 4 relays are working correctly. 

If bypassRelaysOK is true (1), then open the 4 relays to prepare forthe power relay test.
"
