N.6510="label"*36x48<M>
n="3 bits each"
N.6511="label"*28x73<M>
n="4 bits each vector"
N.6512="label"*38x65<M>
n="4 bits "
N.6513="label"*86x13<M>
n="17 Bits"
N.6514="label"*78x19<M>
n="0-1000 in incrrements of .1 (10,000)
14 Bits each"
N.6515="comment"*66x47*75x52<M>
C="{\\rtf1\\ansi\\ansicpg1252\\deff0\\deflang1033{\\fonttbl{\\f0\\fnil\\fcharset0 Arial;}}
\\viewkind4\\uc1\\pard\\fs18 1 minute transfer rate:\\par
\\par
Bits - bitpack all integer and float\\par
10 + 3*5 + 17 + 14*6 + 4 + 4*3 = 142 bits every 60 seconds.\\par
\\par
Rates:\\par
142 bits/min = 18 Bytes/min\\par
8520 bits/hr\\par
204480 bits/day\\par
74635200 bits/year\\par
9329400 Bytes/year \\par
777450 Bytes/month\\par
\\par
mqtt 32KByte per packet, can easily send the entirre 142 bits in one packet.\\par
\\par
Without bitpacking the FLOAT values (allow 4 bytes per float value)\\par
integers: 10 + 3*5 + 4 + 3*4 = 41 bits = 6 bytes\\par
floats: 4 bytes each = 4*7 = 28 bytes\\par
Total 34 bytes/min = 272 bits/min (roughly 2x the bitpacked)\\par
approx 1.55MB/month\\par
\\par
\\par
}
"
