n="This function runs when \"runSelfCheckGBL\" = 1
NOTE1:  Prior to running the bypass and power relay checks the technician
MUST turn the thermostat up to a very high or low temperature (depending
if the unit is cooling or heating) to prevent the unit from turning ON during Self Check
NOTE2: Afterr the bypass and power relay checks are complete the technician
MUST adjust the thermostat until at least one channel is ON.  This is required
to check the SAT, RAT, and Amp sensors
"
